*5 Websites ki Reality Check + Kya Free Hai:*

*1. http://dorkgpt.com* 
- *Kya hai*: Google Dorks banane wala AI tool. Hackers use karte hain vulnerable websites dhoondne ke liye.
- *Free hai?*: Haan, basic use free hai.
- *Critic*: "Illegal" nahi hai. Google Dork khud illegal nahi. Lekin isko galat use karke kisi ki site hack karoge to jail pakki. Bhai ne seedha "Capcut pro apk" search karke dikhaya = piracy promote kar raha hai. Yahi wala part risky hai.

*2. http://onlinesim.io*
- *Kya hai*: Temporary/virtual number deta hai SMS receive karne ke liye. OTP bypass karne ke kaam aata hai.
- *Free hai?*: Haan, kuch countries ke number free hain. Baaki paid. Video mein France ke free number dikhaye.
- *Critic*: 100% legal hai. Spam, fake account banane ke liye use hota hai isliye badnaam hai. "Illegal" bolna jhooth hai. Privacy ke liye theek hai, scam ke liye nahi.

*3. http://facecheck.id*
- *Kya hai*: Photo upload karo, internet par us chehre ki saari profiles dhoond deta hai. Reverse face search.
- *Free hai?*: Nahi. Free mein 1-2 search, uske baad paise maangta hai. Video mein bhi "Upgrade" ka button dikh raha tha.
- *Critic*: Ye wala sabse khatarnak hai. Stalking, doxxing ke liye use hota hai. Legal grey area. Bina permission kisi ki photo search karna ethics ke hisaab se ganda kaam hai. "Kundli nikalna" bolna irresponsible hai.

*4. http://wifimap.io*
- *Kya hai*: Aas-paas ke public WiFi ka map + password dikhata hai jo logon ne share kiye hain.
- *Free hai?*: Haan, app/website free hai.
- *Critic*: "Illegal" nahi. Ye crowdsourced data hai. Lekin kisi ke private WiFi ka password use karna bina permission ke chori hai. Video mein "location aur password pata chal jayega" bolna logon ko galat kaam ki taraf push karna hai.

*5. http://mindluster.com / http://mindluster.com*
- *Kya hai*: Free online courses + certificate wali website. Udemy jaisi.
- *Free hai?*: Haan, 300,000+ courses free hain certificate ke saath.
- *Critic*: Ye to bilkul legal aur achi website hai. Isko "illegal" list mein daalna pure views ke liye hai. Sabse bekar point yahi hai.

---

*Final Verdict:*
Bhai ka maksad "illegal" batana nahi tha, maksad tha *FOLLOW, SAVE, SHARE* karwana. Isliye thumbnail par jail ki salakhain aur "5 ILLEGAL" likha. 

*Sach:* 
- Inme se 3 bilkul legal hain: onlinesim, wifimap, mindluster
- 1 grey area: facecheck 
- 1 tool hai jiska use illegal ho sakta hai: dorkgpt

*Meri salah:* Mindluster courses ke liye acha hai. Baaki 4 ko samajh ke use karna. Facecheck aur dorkgpt galat use kiya to sach mein problem ho sak
